      "slot": "am",
      "publishAt": "2026-08-03T00:00:00.000Z",
      "text": "Whatever's half-finished is allowed to stay half-finished. Pick it up when you're ready.",
      "source": "fallback"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-08-04-am",
      "date": "2026-08-04",
      "slot": "am",
      "publishAt": "2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z",
      "text": "Nothing has to be figured out all at once. You're allowed to just be here for a minute.",
      "source": "fallback"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-08-05-am",
      "date": "2026-08-05",
      "slot": "am",
      "publishAt": "2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z",
      "text": "Drink some water, unclench your jaw, and go be a person.",
      "source": "fallback"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-08-07-am",
      "date": "2026-08-07",
      "slot": "am",
      "publishAt": "2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z",
      "text": "You're allowed to start before you feel ready.",
      "source": "fallback"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-08-08-am",
      "date": "2026-08-08",
      "slot": "am",
      "publishAt": "2026-08-08T00:00:00.000Z",
      "text": "Low stakes. Take it gentle.",
      "source": "fallback"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-08-09-am",
      "date": "2026-08-09",
      "slot": "am",
      "publishAt": "2026-08-09T00:00:00.000Z",
      "text": "You're trying, and that quietly counts more than it feels like it does.",
      "source": "fallback"
    },
    {
